{"id":"15A","title":"Charity and Hospitality","part":{"n":15,"title":"General welfare"},"url":"/law/15-general-welfare/15a","entries":[{"id":"15A.1","text":"We are to be charitable to the poor and hungry.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":15,"verses":"7-8"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":25,"verses":"40-45"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":13,"verses":"1"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":14,"verses":"1"},{"book":"2 Peter","chapter":1,"verses":"7"},{"book":"1 John","chapter":3,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"Deut. 15:7-8; Matt. 25:40-45; 1 Cor. 13; 1 Cor. 14:1; 2 Pet 1:7; 1 John 3:17."},{"id":"15A.2","text":"Acts of uncharitableness towards the poor are condemned.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":29,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":32,"verses":"7"},{"book":"James","chapter":2,"verses":"15-16"}],"citation":"Prov. 29:7; Isa. 32:7; James 2:15-16."},{"id":"15A.3","text":"If because of food your brother is hurt, you are no longer walking charitably.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":14,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"Rom. 14:15."},{"id":"15A.4","text":"The love of God does not dwell in those that are uncharitable.","refs":[{"book":"1 John","chapter":3,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"1 John 3:17."},{"id":"15A.5","text":"It is more blessed to give than to receive.","refs":[{"book":"Acts","chapter":20,"verses":"35"}],"citation":"Acts 20:35."},{"id":"15A.6","text":"Every man is to give according to the purpose that God has placed in his heart.","refs":[{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":9,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"2 Cor. 9:7."},{"id":"15A.7","text":"Do not neglect to show hospitality to strangers, for by so doing some have entertained angels without knowing it.","refs":[{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":13,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Heb. 13:2."},{"id":"15A.8","text":"Charity and love is to be sought above all things.","refs":[{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"Col. 3:14."},{"id":"15A.9","text":"We are to be hospitable towards one another without grudging.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":12,"verses":"13"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":5,"verses":"10"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":4,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Rom. 12:13; 1 Tim. 5:10; 1 Pet 4:9."},{"id":"15A.10","text":"Give not grudgingly or of necessity, for God loves a cheerful giver.","refs":[{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":9,"verses":"7"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":4,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"2 Cor. 9:7; 1 Pet. 4:9."},{"id":"15A.11","text":"Aid and hospitality is to be given to the poor.","refs":[{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":58,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":14,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"Isa. 58:7; Luke 14:13."},{"id":"15A.12","text":"The righteous man gives his bread to the hungry, and covers the naked with clothing, but the unrighteous man who oppresses the poor and needy shall not live.","refs":[{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":18,"verses":"5,7,12,13"}],"citation":"Ezek. 18:5, 7, 12, 13."},{"id":"15A.13","text":"Charity shall cover a multitude of sins.","refs":[{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":4,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"1 Pet. 4:8."},{"id":"15A.14","text":"Let no one seek his own good, but that of his neighbor.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":10,"verses":"24"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 10:24."},{"id":"15A.15","text":"Uncharitableness brings a curse.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":21,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":28,"verses":"27"}],"citation":"Prov. 21:13; Prov. 28:27."},{"id":"15A.16","text":"Give to him who asks of you, and do not turn away from him who wants to borrow from you.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":5,"verses":"42"}],"citation":"Matt. 5:42."}]}